WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.690
Apologize for what?

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:15.990
For the color of your hair,
and for putting you on that throne.

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.740
I'm to blame for all of it.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.950
I never even tried to face up to it.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:26.250
Not to you, and not to my own weakness.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.210
What are you saying?

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:33.050
You think I'm strong, but that's not really true.

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:34.930
I'm weak.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:41.220
That day, if only I was strong enough
to face you when you surpassed me...

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.190
Then we wouldn't have ended up like this.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.230
I should have...

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.900
I'm the one who taught you.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.030
Even though I taught you...

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.530
You're getting better than me.

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:01.620
This can't happen.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:06.420
My jealousy of you as you got better...

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.750
Being pursued, then overtaken.

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:10.880
The fear of being left behind.

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:17.220
If you're really strong, then you can overcome
those feelings and face your opponent.

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:19.760
But that wasn't me.

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:24.100
Unable to face my own weakness...

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:25.980
That day, I...

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:28.310
I fled from it all.

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:32.440
You're strong.

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:34.240
I'm weak.

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:36.650
I was unwilling to accept that.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.410
So I kept avoiding showdowns with you.

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:44.290
The truth was that I was fleeing
from my own weakness.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:45.870
Teruto.

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:47.210
Master.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:50.420
But I'm not running anymore.

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:55.670
For my sake and your sake,
I'll accept my own weakness.

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:59.050
I'll go down the path that leads to you.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:33.480
#12 End of the Road

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.110
Let's go, Kikka.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:37.440
Accept.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.780
Bertruga, Black Sword Dragon.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:41.150
Activating ability.

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.110
Discarding Rizome from my hand,

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:46.160
and decreasing Margreia and Helmina's
power by seven thousand.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.950
He destroyed two units at once.

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:51.790
Now I'm activating Tower of Trials' ability.

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:55.250
Revealing the top two cards of my deck.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:59.420
Adding Bertruga to my hand,
and sending Xenos to the Cemetery.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:02.510
Also activating Bloom's ability.

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:04.340
Accept.

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.260
Rizome, Black Knight.

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:09.810
Activating Bertruga's ability.

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:12.850
By removing two cards from the Cemetery,
I'm increasing his power by one thousand.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:15.270
Attacking Elizabelt.

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:22.360
Using Rizome to attack the other Elizabelt.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.030
He's eliminated four units now.

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:29.450
Not to mention,
Teruto still has Bloom and Rizome.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:32.160
Master hasn't given up.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:36.290
He's facing Kikka and charging down his path.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.210
I should've done this sooner.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:42.840
All because I was weak.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.180
I avoided battling you.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.350
<i>I'm going.</i>

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:50.760
<i>One more time.</i>

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.770
<i>To Neo Kyoto.</i>

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:55.770
In order to see you.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.940
In order to save you.

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:01.320
Kikka.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.280
Teruto...

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.030
Teruto.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.460
It's Teruto.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:18.040
The Teruto I wanted to see is here.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:20.590
I'm so happy.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:23.880
I can't remember the last time I was this happy.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:29.220
Teruto always enjoyed playing Build-Divide.

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:34.480
That's the Teruto I wanted to catch up to,
so I gave it my all.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:40.690
The Build-Divide match I've always
hoped for is happening now.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.400
Kikka.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:46.450
Today, you and I play for keeps.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.990
Right. Let's go, Teruto.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.960
I can hear the song of joy.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:00.420
More. Show me more.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:06.340
Your collective power as siblings
will take me to the next dimension.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.510
My turn. Draw.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:13.760
Since you've brought your A game,
I've got to bring mine.

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:14.680
Accept.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.480
Elvieu.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:19.480
Elvieu?

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.980
A decoy will be troublesome.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.690
Now activating Epitaph of Conviction's ability.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:26.940
Increasing all units' power by three thousand.

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:29.490
Using Elvieu to attack Rizome.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:34.030
My turn. Draw.

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:36.950
Activating Tower of Trials' ability.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:44.340
Adding Rizome to my hand,
and sending Cursed Trump Card to the Cemetery.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:45.500
Accept.

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:47.340
Bertruga.

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:52.930
Activating ability.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.470
Decreasing Elvieu's power by seven thousand.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:58.230
Now, activating Bloom's ability.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:01.440
Rise up again from the darkness.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.020
Rizome, Black Knight.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.490
Here I go, Kikka.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.990
Attacking Elvieu.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:14.830
He took Elvieu down.

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:18.540
Using Bertruga to launch a Two-Hit Attack on Kikka.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.920
Lives are one to one.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:26.000
They're equal.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:31.050
What a rollercoaster of a battle.
They're bringing the heat.

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:37.640
Coming back from that life deficit.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.020
Way to go.

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.480
You too.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:44.020
Teruto has the advantage, with three units.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:47.440
If he can hold on for the next turn, he can win.

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:54.160
Just as I thought, you're the only one
who can drive me to the brink.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:56.780
I'm sure you can see your path to victory now.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:01.830
But by the same token,
I'm the only one who can block your path.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:05.290
I'm not conceding an inch this battle.

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:07.590
My turn. Draw.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.260
Accept.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.050
Elvieu, Angel of Embrace.

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:14.970
Activating Epitaph of Conviction's ability.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:18.350
Increasing all units' power by three thousand.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:19.350
Crap.

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:20.640
Master!

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.440
Here I go, Teruto.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:26.770
Using Elvieu to attack Rizome.

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:29.020
Disappear, Rizome.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:35.820
No way.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.160
His opponent is also down to one life.

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:43.210
If he wants to defeat Elvieu,
having just Bloom and Bertruga won't cut it.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.460
He can't extinguish that life.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.920
Not that I know what's in Teruto's hand.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:51.800
He might just have to gamble on his next draw.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.260
It was just one more push.

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:59.100
He's finally come this close.

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:04.560
Master said it himself, that he wanted to start over.

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:10.980
That he really loves Kikka, and wants to reconcile.

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:15.860
That's what helped him get this far.

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:21.450
Sakura, please help Master out.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:25.960
Please guide him to the path of victory.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.790
All right. It's your turn, Teruto.

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:36.880
Draw.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:44.390
So now you decide to show up.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:46.890
Master?

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:53.150
No. The one guiding me was always you.

00:09:58.740 --> 00:09:59.990
Accept.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:03.620
TX-07 Dio Sirius.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:05.040
Iora!

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:14.800
Iora?

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.090
Seriously?

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.470
What a play.

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:26.430
Kikka. I can see the path I need to take.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.940
I'm going to trust that path and move forward.

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:31.020
Why...

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:35.190
Why do you have that card, Teruto? Why?

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.030
Do you feel that strongly about Sakura?

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:37.990
Kikka.

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:40.610
This is your Iora.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:41.620
Huh?

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:48.620
That day, I stole it from you. This Iora.

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:55.960
Now, I'm returning this card to you.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:57.920
By defeating you.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:02.850
Come. The one who carves out the path.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:06.520
Activating Iora's ability. Scout Three.

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:13.900
Now, activating Tower of Trials' ability.

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:18.240
Adding Aria of Bloody Revenge to my hand.

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.110
I see, this just might...

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:21.320
...be enough.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:24.990
I'm going to trust the path that I take.

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:27.200
At the end of that path, Kikka...

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.120
There's you.

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:35.040
Using my remaining three Energy cards.

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.590
Accept.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.550
Aria of Bloody Revenge.

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:43.760
Using Aria to attack Elvieu.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:44.470
Not yet.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.640
Activating Elvieu's ability.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.060
Increasing her power by three thousand.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:54.520
Using Bertruga to attack Elvieu.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:11:59.690
He took her down.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:02.360
His opponent's field is totally empty.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:11.540
You said I'm the one who made you strong,
but you did the same for me.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:15.710
You're the reason I was able to make it this far.

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.590
This is the end.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.880
Using Bloom to attack Kikka.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:39.020
Her lives are down to...

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:40.150
...zero.

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:51.000
Iora.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.180
<i>All I wanted was...</i>

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.890
<i>...to see Teruto.</i>

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:24.320
What is this?

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:28.910
Congratulations.

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:35.160
You will now be offered to the King,
sacrificing that body of yours.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:38.670
By doing so, you will eventually
get to see your big brother.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.630
Your wish will be granted, little girl.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:45.010
No. I just want to see Teruto.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.510
Let me see him.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:54.850
<i>No. No, this wasn't supposed to happen.</i>

00:13:55.520 --> 00:14:00.190
<i>I came here because I was sure
I'd play Build-Divide with Teruto again.</i>

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:02.980
<i>Why is this happening?</i>

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:04.820
<i>I want to see Teruto.</i>

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:06.570
<i>I want to play with Teruto.</i>

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:08.320
<i>But...</i>

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:11.240
<i>Will that actually make him smile?</i>

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:15.450
<i>Teruto might not be happy to see me.</i>

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:21.290
<i>In that case, it'd be better if
he doesn't see the real me.</i>

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:33.890
<i>Please. The me that isn't me.</i>

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:36.890
<i>Go to where Teruto is.</i>

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:39.850
<i>So Teruto can have fun playing.</i>

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:43.820
<i>I want you to stay by Teruto's side.</i>

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:50.660
<i>Please.</i>

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.620
<i>In my place.</i>

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.750
<i>Please.</i>

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.780
Using Iora to attack Kikka.

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:42.290
<i>That was such a fun battle.</i>

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:44.920
<i>Thank you, Teruto.</i>

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:48.920
<i>I'm sorry, Sakura.</i>

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:06.230
Winner. Teruto Kurabe.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:10.900
Yes!

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:12.950
Master won.

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:18.540
What's going on?

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.120
Oh dear.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.500
Damn.

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:26.000
Master. Kikka.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.670
Naomitsu?

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:40.060
I still have some business to take care of.

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:43.940
What's this?

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:45.770
Kikka, hang on.

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:47.190
Teruto.

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:48.320
Come, hurry!

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:49.530
Okay.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.320
Kikka!

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:55.450
Don't worry, I promise to save you. Don't let go.

00:16:57.990 --> 00:16:59.200
Teruto!

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:04.500
No way am I letting them turn you into an offering.

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:06.460
I'm saving you no matter what.

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:15.930
Teruto.

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:17.340
Bloom.

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:21.020
Please, Bloom. Help me!

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:26.440
Come. Come to where I am.

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:28.020
Will.

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:30.980
What happened?

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:34.950
There's a connection error
between the King and the lifeform.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:39.070
The cause is unknown,
but it seems to have been severed by force.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:40.780
What shall I do?

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:43.830
Don't tell me this is Teruto Kurabe's work?

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.540
Restore the connection.

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:46.960
Don't let them escape.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.210
I'm not handing over Kikka.

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:56.340
Teruto.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:58.300
Bloom!

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:03.930
Master Higuma, the bugs are
infesting the program as we speak.

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:05.680
Curses.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.520
I found you, Mario Higuma.

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:09.860
Who are you?

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:16.200
We finally meet, Father.

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.700
Don't you dare say you've forgotten.

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:21.530
You're number eight?

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:23.160
Yeah, that's right.

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:27.160
The biotoken you disposed of.

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:33.340
I came from that world to shove you into hell.

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:35.800
Brace yourself, bastard.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:39.510
Bloom!

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:42.180
I'll take care of it.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:45.680
No. I don't want to survive alone.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:47.270
You have to be with me—

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:50.600
Master, I'll rescue you now.

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:52.730
No! Don't come near us.

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:57.650
I'm okay. I'm sending you all
back to the world you came from.

00:18:58.650 --> 00:18:59.780
Teruto.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:02.700
Kikka. I'm glad I got to see you.

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:05.540
Leave the rest to me.

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:10.830
Hiyori. You followed me even though
I didn't teach you anything.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:11.920
That's my bad.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:16.050
Starting now, this path is yours alone.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:19.470
You decide the best part of it.

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:22.390
Please wait, Master!

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:24.930
I had so much fun because of you and Sakura.

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:25.930
Master!

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:26.850
Teruto!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:31.350
See you. Hiyori. Kikka.

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:49.250
Master...

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:52.630
Huh?

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.670
I guess I should save her, right?

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:06.310
I can send out units here, right?

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:10.270
Not only are you useless,
but you're also a nuisance.

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:13.480
Master Higuma, you should withdraw for now.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.690
The infestation threat is looming close.

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:19.320
Hey, listen.

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:23.070
This story. It's going to take a bit longer.

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:24.280
Ishinome?

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:27.030
Just how long are you making me wait?

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:28.490
What did you say?

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:32.250
Well, I think I'm going to step out for a bit.

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:33.000
Ciao.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.500
Bastard, wait.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.080
Master...

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.250
Master!

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:39.020
What...

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:40.770
...is this?

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:40.020
TO BE CONTINUED
